    // \d etc colored 103;30
    // {m} colored 104;37

    // So we can apply same colorizer to each line of verbose output, preserving indentation and newlines.

    // We'll implement by applying colorize_plain_v2 to the whole verbose string, but need to ensure newlines and spaces preserved.

